1
00:00:04,567 --> 00:00:07,600
Our goal: a personal touch with every shipowner, every day.

2
00:00:07,600 --> 00:00:11,633
The market: $10.5bn in hull premiums in 2025, up 9.4%.

3
00:00:11,633 --> 00:00:14,867
About 112,500 vessels. Every one needs cover every year.

4
00:00:14,867 --> 00:00:18,800
Renewals are won by those who stay in touch all year.

5
00:00:18,800 --> 00:00:25,533
01 · Renewal radar: every vessel, owner group and renewal date.

6
00:00:25,533 --> 00:00:28,667
Aegean Star’s hull renews in 21 days. Last touch: 41 days ago.

7
00:00:28,667 --> 00:00:32,500
One tap: the agent drafts a personal message.

8
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:37,133
Signals too: a newbuilding delivered, a voyage into a war-risk area.

9
00:00:37,133 --> 00:00:42,167
02 · Sales is a numbers game: the law of large numbers.

10
00:00:42,167 --> 00:00:45,200
1% of 10,000 touches is about 100 placements.

11
00:00:45,200 --> 00:00:49,433
A cadence for each owner: intro, market note, renewal reminder, call.

12
00:00:49,433 --> 00:00:53,567
03 · WhatsApp, Telegram, WeChat and email in one feed.

13
00:00:53,567 --> 00:00:57,700
A master’s photo becomes text. A voice note becomes a transcript.

14
00:00:57,700 --> 00:01:01,833
04 · Each owner has an AI agent that knows the whole history.

15
00:01:01,833 --> 00:01:06,067
It builds the renewal submission and finds what’s missing.

16
00:01:06,067 --> 00:01:10,200
05 · Quotes side by side: rate, deductible, line, wording.

17
00:01:10,200 --> 00:01:13,033
The agent counts the real cost, not just the rate.

18
00:01:13,033 --> 00:01:17,567
06 · Claims desk: from the first photo to a file with a checklist.

19
00:01:17,567 --> 00:01:20,000
Great service today wins the renewal tomorrow.

20
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:26,133
07 · Nothing goes out without your “yes”.

21
00:01:26,133 --> 00:01:32,467
08 · Run the day by voice. “Hey Siri, Pult.”

22
00:01:32,467 --> 00:01:41,600
09 · The common language of marine insurance, like in aviation.

23
00:01:41,600 --> 00:01:45,733
Few words, clear symbols. The agent speaks it, so your team does too.

24
00:01:45,733 --> 00:01:50,167
Business helps business. AI helps both.
